"Rapport III's training fields host days-long simulated battles against chaos in three regions."
"Senior knights command regions; squads volunteer for tasks and keep a prize 'treat' for success."
"Achievements earn stitches on coats, and squads barter prizes."
"Vehicles and enchanted weapons are shared and limited; a damaged one is removed for everyone."
"The Contract manages the battle, reports damage and protects participants; 'injured' sit out."
"Squads may summon a limited number of Avowed; mock demon swarms are called flockers."
